        <footnote id="F1">Reflects vesting of Restricted Stock Units (&quot;RSUs&quot;) on May 21, 2026.  The Reporting Person initially received 36,965 time-based RSUs on May 23, 2025. The RSUs vest in full on the earlier of: (i) the first anniversary of the date of the grant; (ii) the date of the succeeding year's annual meeting of stockholders; or (iii) any change-in-control event (as defined in the RSU Agreement).</footnote>
